      "description": {
        "es": "Pone nervioso al rival y le impide usar bayas.",
        "en": "Opposing Pokémon cannot eat held Berries while this Pokémon is in battle. Affected Pokémon can still use Bug Bite or Pluck to eat a target's Berry."
      }
    },
